    "updated_at": "2021-01-12T12:06:01Z",
    "body": "I had the very same issue with Konsole and solved it successfully in the manner as @chipbuster described. I'm using Manjaro (Kernel 5.10.2) with KDE Plasma 5.2 (KDE Framework 5.77).\r\n\r\nIn my particular case I setup Nono Mono Emoji font as fallback font. This [gist](https://gist.github.com/yzhernand/10bc8824e1018a4e7709c73b6c33bc01) worked for me. There are also some related versions that may work for you (check where the gist been forked from).",
    "author_association": "NONE",
